A.aBQ=s(['No live or historical mandi rates. Ever. No scrape, no feed, no "yesterday\'s arrival price". boliseema has no internet at runtime. The retail rate is a number you type because you already know it.',"No credit, udhaar or dues ledger of any kind. boliseema never records who owes what.","No staff attendance or wage register. Hamali is a per-crate charge you type, not a worker record.","No sales, stock or day-book entry during trading hours. There is nothing here to tap while you are selling.",'No "should you buy" verdict, no walk-away advice, no bid recommendation. boliseema prints a ceiling; you decide.',"No quality or grade model, no weather, no seasonality, no forecast.","No accounts, no sync, no cloud, no sharing a card with another vendor.",'No AI and no "smart" anything. It is seven integer functions.',"lagaat decodes the bill you were handed AFTER the auction \u2014 what it actually cost. boliseema sets the ceiling BEFORE the auction \u2014 what you may pay. Nothing crosses: boliseema never ingests a bill, lagaat never emits a bid.","paavbhav prices what you sell; boliseema prices what you buy.","stallpack reconciles what you packed out against what came back; boliseema decides what to bring home in the first place. cropmath costs a farmer's acre; boliseema costs a trader's trip."],t.s)
